;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball, SHA-256 fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba):
;; lambda/translcore.ml (expressions, applications with omitted and optional arguments, curried functions,
;; let, match with exception cases, try, records, arrays, assertions), lambda/translprim.ml (the primitives'
;; table, their specialization by type, comparisons) and the bytecode translation of a structure of
;; lambda/translmod.ml, for the core language (doc/ocaml/TYPER.md), whose notices follow (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml
;; Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
;;             Xavier Leroy, projet Cristal, INRIA Rocquencourt
;;
;;   Copyright 1996 Institut National de Recherche en Informatique et
;;     en Automatique.
